{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MZscWH9cs67qk7wxXZscug","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: Claim 1从'more than all others combined'降级为'single largest source'，headline用跨benchmark\n2\t  range（30-55%）。Claim 2 separability加条件限定'at aggregate level for MC benchmarks'，承认reasoning\n3\t  tasks中temperature/seed interaction更大。Claim 3 D-study budget效果量缩小（tripling items从10×变为3-5×优于tripling\n4\t  prompts）。Hardware facet若数据不完整则降级为limitation。论文重心转向'benchmark-dependent variance\n5\t  structure'。\n6\timagined_experiments:\n7\t- name: Full-scale Precision Study (Confound Fixed)\n8\t  plan_id: exp-001\n9\t  description: 4 models × 3 precisions × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps × 4 orderings\n10\t    × 200 MMLU items, all using V0 enforce_eager\n11\t  expected_results:\n12\t    total_conditions: 1296_per_model\n13\t    total_records: 1036800\n14\t    item_id_variance_share: 0.43\n15\t    residual: 0.21\n16\t    precision_main_effect: 0.008\n17\t    precision_x_item: 0.032\n18\t    temperature_x_item: 0.058\n19\t    prompt_x_item: 0.062\n20\t    seed_x_item: 0.024\n21\t    ordering_main_effect: 0.004\n22\t    prompt_main_effect: 0.012\n23\t    temperature_main_effect: 0.015\n24\t    item_conditional_interactions_total: 0.176\n25\t    direct_infra_method_interaction: 0.003\n26\t    g_coefficient_current_practice: 0.42\n27\t    accuracy_bf16: 0.681\n28\t    accuracy_fp16: 0.679\n29\t    accuracy_fp32: 0.674\n30\t    model_agreement: 3 of 4 models show item_id as largest; Gemma-2 shows elevated\n31\t      prompt_x_item (~0.09) pulling item_id share to 0.36\n32\t  result_rationale: 修复float32 confound后，MVP中precision=0.0087的main effect基本维持（因为BF16/FP16本身仍有差异），但precision×item从0.072骤降至0.032——MVP中float32使用了不同engine路径导致特定难题上的accuracy骤降，这部分interaction被消除。item_id纯方差从0.584降至0.43：原来的0.584中约有10-12pp是precision×item和temperature×item\n33\t    interaction在单一precision条件下被吸收进item主效应（50 items时估计不稳定）。200 items的stratified sampling提供更稳定估计，residual从0.176升至0.21反映了更大item\n34\t    pool中的unmodeled item×condition microvariance。Gemma-2-9B-IT因其instruction-tuning风格对prompt\n35\t    wording异常敏感（已知其system prompt格式要求严格），prompt×item interaction偏高，拉低了该模型的item_id相对份额。整体G=0.42仍然很低，验证了current\n36\t    practice不可靠的核心论点。\n37\t  tables:\n38\t  - 'Table 1: Variance component estimates (% of total) by model — 4×12 matrix showing\n39\t    each component per model plus pooled'\n40\t  - 'Table 2: Accuracy means by precision level per model — confirms confound fix\n41\t    (三者差异<1pp vs MVP的8.5pp)'\n42\t  - 'Table 3: Model-level G coefficients under current practice conditions'\n43\t  figures_description:\n44\t  - 'Fig 1: Stacked bar chart of variance components, 4 models side-by-side + pooled,\n45\t    showing item_id consistently largest but varying 36-48%'\n46\t  - 'Fig 2: Heatmap of item×precision interaction — showing which item difficulty\n47\t    bins still show precision sensitivity after fix'\n48\t  analysis: 'Two-way ANOVA确认precision main effect在fix后从显著(p<0.001, η²=0.009)降为边际(p=0.03,\n49\t    η²=0.008)。Bootstrap CI for item_id share: [0.38, 0.48]。Gemma异常通过leave-one-model-out\n50\t    sensitivity analysis量化——移除Gemma后pooled item_id升至0.46。'\n51\t- name: Multi-Benchmark Replication\n52\t  plan_id: exp-002\n53\t  description: 4 models × 2 precisions × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temps × 4 orderings\n54\t    on GSM8K/ARC-C/HellaSwag (200 items each)\n55\t  expected_results:\n56\t    total_records_per_benchmark: 230400\n57\t    gsm8k_item_id_share: 0.28\n58\t    gsm8k_temperature_x_item: 0.12\n59\t    gsm8k_seed_x_item: 0.08\n60\t    gsm8k_residual: 0.27\n61\t    gsm8k_prompt_main: 0.03\n62\t    arc_challenge_item_id_share: 0.38\n63\t    arc_challenge_residual: 0.22\n64\t    arc_challenge_temperature_x_item: 0.07\n65\t    hellaswag_item_id_share: 0.45\n66\t    hellaswag_residual: 0.19\n67\t    hellaswag_prompt_x_item: 0.05\n68\t    cross_benchmark_item_dominance_as_largest: 3/4 benchmarks (GSM8K exception — residual+temp×item\n69\t      jointly exceed item_id)\n70\t    cross_benchmark_separability_holds: 3/4 benchmarks (direct infra×method < 0.02\n71\t      everywhere)\n72\t    g_gsm8k_current: 0.35\n73\t    g_arc_current: 0.4\n74\t    g_hellaswag_current: 0.48\n75\t    replication_rate_item_as_single_largest: 0.625\n76\t  result_rationale: GSM8K是reasoning task，CoT generation引入大量stochastic variance——temperature直接影响推理链的分支选择，且不同seed下同一难题可能走完全不同的推理路径，导致temperature×item和seed×item\n77\t    interaction显著放大（合计0.20 vs MMLU的0.08）。residual也更高（0.27）因为generation过程本质上比MC selection更noisy。item_id仍有0.28但不再是单一最大源——residual(0.27)+temperature×item(0.12)合并后超过它。ARC-Challenge是science\n78\t    MC，结构更接近MMLU但题目难度分布更极端（容易题ceiling effect），item_id=0.38。HellaSwag最接近MMLU pattern（都是MC、都是knowledge/commonsense），item_id=0.45。跨benchmark的核心发现：MC\n79\t    benchmarks中item dominance稳健成立，但reasoning/generation benchmarks中variance structure根本不同——这本身成为novel\n80\t    finding。Separability在所有benchmark都成立（direct interaction<0.02），因为hardware/precision\n81\t    effects是low-level numerical的，与task type无关。\n82\t  tables:\n83\t  - 'Table 4: Cross-benchmark variance decomposition comparison — 4 benchmarks × top-8\n84\t    components matrix'\n85\t  - 'Table 5: Benchmark characteristics (task type, answer format, difficulty distribution)\n86\t    vs variance structure mapping'\n87\t  figures_description:\n88\t  - 'Fig 3: Grouped stacked bars — 4 benchmarks side-by-side showing how variance\n89\t    structure shifts from MC (item-dominated) to reasoning (residual/interaction-dominated)'\n90\t  - 'Fig 4: Scatter plot of item difficulty vs item-level variance contribution across\n91\t    benchmarks — showing ceiling/floor effects'\n92\t  analysis: 'Kruskal-Wallis test on per-item variance contributions across benchmarks\n93\t    confirms significant structural difference (H=47.3, p<0.001)。Permutation test\n94\t    for ''item_id is single largest component'' yields replication probability 0.63\n95\t    across random benchmark subsets。Key narrative shift: item dominance is benchmark-type-dependent,\n96\t    strongest for knowledge MC tasks, weaker for reasoning generation tasks。'\n97\t- name: Multi-Hardware G-Study\n98\t  plan_id: exp-003\n99\t  description: 4 models × 2 GPU types × 2 precisions × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps\n100\t    × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items\n101\t  expected_results:\n102\t    hardware_status: second GPU arrived late — only 2 models × reduced seeds(3) completed\n103\t      on GPU-2\n104\t    hardware_main_effect: 0.012\n105\t    hardware_x_precision: 0.006\n106\t    hardware_x_prompt: 0.002\n107\t    hardware_x_item: 0.018\n108\t    hardware_x_temperature: 0.003\n109\t    total_hardware_related_variance: 0.041\n110\t    direct_hardware_x_methodology_interaction: 0.005\n111\t    separability_conclusion: holds at aggregate level — direct hardware×method < 1%\n112\t    item_id_with_hardware_facet: 0.41\n113\t    g_with_hardware_generalization: 0.38\n114\t    completeness: partial — 2/4 models fully crossed, 2/4 models only on primary GPU\n115\t  result_rationale: 第二块GPU延迟到达，只能对Qwen3-8B和Llama-3.1-8B做完整crossing（reduced seeds=3以控制时间）。Hardware\n116\t    main effect=0.012来自GPU间的kernel implementation差异（不同SM架构的floating-point rounding\n117\t    path不同），但远小于item_id。hardware×item=0.018表明特定难题在不同GPU上表现不同——这是因为numerical edge cases（接近decision\n118\t    boundary的logits）在不同GPU architecture上round differently。Direct hardware×methodology\n119\t    interaction仅0.005，验证separability——但这个结论基于incomplete crossing需要谨慎表述。数据不完整意味着hardware\n120\t    facet的估计CI较宽，论文中需作为limitation明确说明，但核心separability finding的方向性仍可支持。\n121\t  tables:\n122\t  - 'Table 6: Hardware facet variance components (with CI) — noting which estimates\n123\t    are based on reduced crossing'\n124\t  - 'Table 7: Separability test — direct interaction terms between hardware and each\n125\t    methodology facet'\n126\t  figures_description:\n127\t  - 'Fig 5: Forest plot of hardware-related variance components with 95% bootstrap\n128\t    CIs — showing most CIs include zero except hardware×item'\n129\t  analysis: 'Mixed-effects model with GPU as random effect confirms hardware contributes\n130\t    <2% unique variance。Acknowledge limitation: only 2 GPU types × partial model crossing\n131\t    — separability conclusion is directional, not definitive。Frame as ''consistent\n132\t    with separability'' rather than ''proves separability''。计划在camera-ready前补充完整数据。'\n133\t- name: D-Study Projections\n134\t  plan_id: exp-004\n135\t  description: Compute optimal measurement allocation from combined exp-001/002/003\n136\t    variance components\n137\t  expected_results:\n138\t    g_current_practice_mmlu: 0.42\n139\t    g_current_practice_gsm8k: 0.35\n140\t    g_current_practice_pooled: 0.39\n141\t    g_triple_items_mmlu: 0.82\n142\t    g_triple_prompts_mmlu: 0.51\n143\t    g_triple_seeds_mmlu: 0.44\n144\t    g_optimal_600items_mmlu: 0.87\n145\t    g_optimal_600items_3prompts_mmlu: 0.91\n146\t    items_needed_for_g90_mmlu: 520\n147\t    items_needed_for_g90_gsm8k: 780\n148\t    items_needed_for_g90_hellaswag: 380\n149\t    cost_ratio_items_vs_prompts_for_g90: 3.8\n150\t    cost_ratio_items_vs_seeds_for_g90: 7.2\n151\t    budget_table_achievable_g90: 600 items × 3 prompts × 2 seeds — feasible but 3×\n152\t      current practice\n153\t  result_rationale: item_id占比从MVP的58%降至MMLU的43%、跨benchmark均值约35%，导致D-study中tripling\n154\t    items的marginal gain缩小——从MVP预测的G提升0.35降至约0.25。具体来看：G(current)=0.42因为200 items在43%\n155\t    item variance下仍然欠采样（需要~520 items才能让item sampling error降到可接受水平）。Triple items(600)→G=0.82而非MVP外推的0.90+，因为residual(0.21)设定了ceiling——即使无限items，residual\n156\t    variance仍限制G上界约0.93。Triple prompts仅从0.42→0.51因为prompt-related variance(main+interactions)合计才~0.08，三倍prompt只压缩这小部分。Cost\n157\t    ratio从MVP的'10×'降至3.8×：items仍是最cost-effective lever但优势缩小。GSM8K需要更多items(780)因为其residual更高且item\n158\t    variance share更低——每增加一个item压缩的variance比例更小。这个'benchmark-dependent budget'本身成为实用贡献。\n159\t  tables:\n160\t  - 'Table 8: D-study projection matrix — rows=facet allocation scenarios, columns=benchmarks,\n161\t    cells=projected G'\n162\t  - 'Table 9: Practitioner budget table — ''to achieve G≥X on benchmark Y, sample\n163\t    at least Z items with W prompts'''\n164\t  - 'Table 10: Cost-effectiveness ratios — marginal G gain per additional level of\n165\t    each facet'\n166\t  figures_description:\n167\t  - 'Fig 6: D-study curves — G vs number of items, with separate lines per benchmark,\n168\t    horizontal reference at G=0.90'\n169\t  - 'Fig 7: Allocation efficiency surface — 3D plot of items × prompts × projected\n170\t    G, showing diminishing returns'\n171\t  analysis: 'Sensitivity analysis: bootstrap resample variance components 1000×, compute\n172\t    D-study projections for each → 95% CI on ''items needed for G≥0.90'' is [420,\n173\t    680] for MMLU。Key message shift: ''tripling items is 3-5× more effective than\n174\t    tripling prompts'' (down from ''10×'' in MVP)。仍然是strong practical recommendation但headline数字需要honest\n175\t    reporting。'\n176\t- name: 14B Model Extension\n177\t  plan_id: exp-005\n178\t  description: Qwen3-14B and DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B at BF16/FP16 on MMLU 200 items\n179\t  expected_results:\n180\t    qwen3_14b_item_id_share: 0.46\n181\t    deepseek_r1_14b_item_id_share: 0.34\n182\t    qwen3_14b_precision_main: 0.005\n183\t    deepseek_r1_precision_main: 0.009\n184\t    deepseek_r1_temperature_x_item: 0.11\n185\t    scale_effect_on_variance_structure: mixed — dense 14B similar to 8B; reasoning-distilled\n186\t      shows more temperature sensitivity\n187\t    g_qwen3_14b_current: 0.47\n188\t    g_deepseek_r1_14b_current: 0.38\n189\t  result_rationale: Qwen3-14B作为dense model的scale-up版本，variance structure与8B系列相似但item_id略高(0.46)——更大模型对easy\n190\t    items更consistently correct，使item difficulty gradient更极端，增加item方差贡献。DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B是reasoning-distilled模型，其CoT倾向使temperature\n191\t    sensitivity大幅升高（temperature×item=0.11），类似GSM8K的pattern——即使在MC task(MMLU)上，该模型也倾向于'思考'，引入generation-like\n192\t    variance。这导致其item_id share仅0.34。这个发现支持'variance structure depends on model architecture,\n193\t    not just task type'的扩展论点。Precision main effect在两个14B模型上都很小（dense model更稳定），验证separability在larger\n194\t    scale也成立。\n195\t  tables:\n196\t  - 'Table 11: 8B vs 14B variance component comparison — paired by architecture family'\n197\t  figures_description:\n198\t  - 'Fig 8: Paired bar chart — 8B vs 14B models showing variance structure shift with\n199\t    scale'\n200\t  analysis: 'Key finding: variance structure is jointly determined by task type AND\n201\t    model architecture (specifically, reasoning-distilled models behave like ''reasoning\n202\t    tasks'' even on MC benchmarks)。This adds nuance to the benchmark-dependent story。'\n203\t- name: Fine-Tuning G-Study\n204\t  plan_id: exp-006\n205\t  description: 'RoBERTa-large on SST-2/MNLI/RTE/COPA: 6 seeds × 3 LR × 4 shuffles\n206\t    × 3 GPUs × 2 precisions = 432 runs/task'\n207\t  expected_results:\n208\t    total_runs: 1728\n209\t    sst2_seed_variance_share: 0.18\n210\t    sst2_lr_variance_share: 0.31\n211\t    sst2_item_id_variance_share: 0.22\n212\t    sst2_shuffle_variance_share: 0.04\n213\t    sst2_gpu_variance_share: 0.003\n214\t    sst2_precision_variance_share: 0.006\n215\t    sst2_residual: 0.15\n216\t    sst2_seed_x_item: 0.05\n217\t    rte_seed_variance_share: 0.28\n218\t    rte_lr_variance_share: 0.22\n219\t    rte_item_id_variance_share: 0.19\n220\t    rte_seed_x_lr: 0.08\n221\t    copa_instability: high residual (0.32) due to small dataset size\n222\t    g_finetuning_current_practice: 0.52\n223\t    g_finetuning_5seeds_3lr: 0.78\n224\t    infra_method_separability_finetuning: holds — GPU×seed interaction < 0.5%\n225\t  result_rationale: Fine-tuning的variance hierarchy与inference根本不同：learning rate成为dominant\n226\t    factor(SST-2上0.31)因为它决定了optimization trajectory的convergence point——不同LR到达不同local\n227\t    minima。Seed是第二大因素(0.18-0.28)因为weight initialization和data ordering jointly决定optimization\n228\t    path。Item_id仍significant(0.19-0.22)但不再dominant——fine-tuning使模型适配了task distribution，减少了item\n229\t    difficulty的极端效应。RTE上seed更重要(0.28)因为小数据集(2.5k training)使optimization对initialization更敏感。GPU\n230\t    variance几乎为零(0.003)因为fine-tuning的随机性远大于hardware-level numerical差异。Data shuffle仅0.04——远低于预期，因为在足够epochs后shuffle的影响被averaged\n231\t    out。核心对比：inference中item dominates(43%)，fine-tuning中LR+seed dominates(~50%)——practitioners需要不同的reproducibility\n232\t    strategies for不同scenarios。\n233\t  tables:\n234\t  - 'Table 12: Fine-tuning variance decomposition — 4 tasks × top-8 components'\n235\t  - 'Table 13: Inference vs fine-tuning variance hierarchy comparison'\n236\t  - 'Table 14: Fine-tuning D-study — seeds and LR needed for G≥0.90'\n237\t  figures_description:\n238\t  - 'Fig 9: Side-by-side stacked bars — inference (MMLU) vs fine-tuning (SST-2) variance\n239\t    decomposition showing inverted hierarchy'\n240\t  - 'Fig 10: Fine-tuning D-study curves — G vs number of seeds, with LR as parameter'\n241\t  analysis: The inverted hierarchy (item→LR+seed) between inference and fine-tuning\n242\t    is a clean novel finding。It explains why the 'run 5 seeds and report mean±std'\n243\t    convention exists for fine-tuning but not for inference evaluation。Separability\n244\t    still holds in fine-tuning (GPU×methodology < 0.5%)，strengthening the cross-scenario\n245\t    generalization of Claim 2。\n246\t- name: LayerCast Precision Study\n247\t  plan_id: exp-007\n248\t  description: LayerCast (FP16 storage + FP32 compute) as 4th precision condition\n249\t    on MMLU\n250\t  expected_results:\n251\t    layercast_accuracy: 0.68\n252\t    layercast_vs_fp32_accuracy_diff: 0.006\n253\t    layercast_vs_bf16_accuracy_diff: -0.001\n254\t    layercast_item_level_agreement_with_bf16: 0.94\n255\t    precision_variance_with_layercast: 0.005\n256\t    precision_x_item_with_layercast: 0.022\n257\t    variance_reduction_vs_mixed_precision: 15-20% reduction in precision-related variance\n258\t      components\n259\t  result_rationale: LayerCast在FP16存储但FP32计算，理论上获得FP32的numerical stability同时保持FP16的memory\n260\t    efficiency。实测accuracy接近BF16/FP16（差异<0.1pp）而非接近pure FP32——这是因为在confound-fixed设置下FP32本身的accuracy已与BF16接近（差异<1pp），LayerCast的'storage\n261\t    in FP16'引入的quantization noise在compute阶段被FP32 accumulation部分补偿。Precision×item interaction从0.032降至0.022——LayerCast减少了precision-sensitive\n262\t    items上的variance但未完全消除（weight quantization仍在）。整体precision-related variance减少约18%，是有意义但非revolutionary的改进。作为mitigation\n263\t    strategy，值得在discussion中推荐但不足以成为standalone contribution。\n264\t  tables:\n265\t  - 'Table 15: 4-level precision comparison (FP32/BF16/FP16/LayerCast) — accuracy\n266\t    and variance metrics'\n267\t  figures_description:\n268\t  - 'Fig 11: Item-level accuracy correlation matrix across 4 precision conditions\n269\t    — showing LayerCast clusters with BF16/FP16'\n270\t  analysis: 'LayerCast provides modest variance reduction but does not fundamentally\n271\t    change the story。Best framed as a practical recommendation in discussion: ''for\n272\t    practitioners concerned about precision effects, LayerCast offers ~18% reduction\n273\t    in precision-related variance at minimal memory cost''。'\n274\t- name: MATH Benchmark Extension\n275\t  plan_id: exp-008\n276\t  description: MATH 200 items — reasoning-heavy with CoT, testing item dominance in\n277\t    extended generation\n278\t  expected_results:\n279\t    math_item_id_share: 0.22\n280\t    math_temperature_main: 0.04\n281\t    math_temperature_x_item: 0.15\n282\t    math_seed_x_item: 0.11\n283\t    math_residual: 0.3\n284\t    math_prompt_x_item: 0.06\n285\t    math_precision_main: 0.005\n286\t    math_g_current: 0.3\n287\t    math_items_for_g90: 950\n288\t    item_dominance_holds: false\n289\t    separability_holds: true\n290\t  result_rationale: MATH是最极端的reasoning benchmark——每题需要多步推导，CoT generation在每一步都受temperature和seed影响。Temperature×item=0.15因为难题（Level\n291\t    4-5）的solution path高度branching——temperature=0.7时可能走对路径，temperature=0.3时可能卡在suboptimal\n292\t    path。Seed×item=0.11同理——不同seed改变了sampling trajectory。Residual高达0.30反映了即使fixed所有facets，generation的intrinsic\n293\t    stochasticity（vLLM default设置下的CUDA nondeterminism在long generation中累积）。Item_id仅0.22——仍然是single\n294\t    largest individual component但margin很小（vs residual 0.30如果将residual视为'unexplained'则item不是最大）。这是median档下GSM8K\n295\t    pattern的加强版，确认了'reasoning tasks have fundamentally different variance structure'。Separability仍成立（precision/hardware与methodology无direct\n296\t    interaction>1%）——numerical precision不影响推理策略选择，只影响individual token probabilities。G=0.30极低，需要~950\n297\t    items才能达到G≥0.90——对MATH这样仅500题的benchmark来说实质上不可达，这本身是对当前evaluation practice的strong\n298\t    critique。\n299\t  tables:\n300\t  - 'Table 16: MATH vs GSM8K vs MMLU variance structure comparison — progression from\n301\t    MC to light-reasoning to heavy-reasoning'\n302\t  figures_description:\n303\t  - 'Fig 12: Variance structure gradient plot — x-axis = ''reasoning intensity'' (MMLU→ARC→GSM8K→MATH),\n304\t    y-axis = component shares, showing smooth transition from item-dominated to residual/interaction-dominated'\n305\t  analysis: 'MATH completes the picture: variance structure is a continuous function\n306\t    of task reasoning demands。For MC knowledge tasks, item selection is the key lever;\n307\t    for reasoning tasks, temperature control and massive item sampling are both needed。The\n308\t    ''one-size-fits-all'' reproducibility budget is insufficient — practitioners need\n309\t    task-type-specific guidance。This benchmark-dependency finding becomes the paper''s\n310\t    central novel contribution under the median tier narrative。'\n311\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"73f25614-6311-4958-8c3c-0f90d7450270","uuid":"248575bc-da68-4fe5-aad9-48deb2d769bb","timestamp":"2026-05-20T19:37:23.175Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519/projects/nlp_variance_gtheory/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260520T190053/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: Claim 1从'more than all others combined'降级为'single largest source'，headline用跨benchmark\n  range（30-55%）。Claim 2 separability加条件限定'at aggregate level for MC benchmarks'，承认reasoning\n  tasks中temperature/seed interaction更大。Claim 3 D-study budget效果量缩小（tripling items从10×变为3-5×优于tripling\n  prompts）。Hardware facet若数据不完整则降级为limitation。论文重心转向'benchmark-dependent variance\n  structure'。\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Full-scale Precision Study (Confound Fixed)\n  plan_id: exp-001\n  description: 4 models × 3 precisions × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps × 4 orderings\n    × 200 MMLU items, all using V0 enforce_eager\n  expected_results:\n    total_conditions: 1296_per_model\n    total_records: 1036800\n    item_id_variance_share: 0.43\n    residual: 0.21\n    precision_main_effect: 0.008\n    precision_x_item: 0.032\n    temperature_x_item: 0.058\n    prompt_x_item: 0.062\n    seed_x_item: 0.024\n    ordering_main_effect: 0.004\n    prompt_main_effect: 0.012\n    temperature_main_effect: 0.015\n    item_conditional_interactions_total: 0.176\n    direct_infra_method_interaction: 0.003\n    g_coefficient_current_practice: 0.42\n    accuracy_bf16: 0.681\n    accuracy_fp16: 0.679\n    accuracy_fp32: 0.674\n    model_agreement: 3 of 4 models show item_id as largest; Gemma-2 shows elevated\n      prompt_x_item (~0.09) pulling item_id share to 0.36\n  result_rationale: 修复float32 confound后，MVP中precision=0.0087的main effect基本维持（因为BF16/FP16本身仍有差异），但precision×item从0.072骤降至0.032——MVP中float32使用了不同engine路径导致特定难题上的accuracy骤降，这部分interaction被消除。item_id纯方差从0.584降至0.43：原来的0.584中约有10-12pp是precision×item和temperature×item\n    interaction在单一precision条件下被吸收进item主效应（50 items时估计不稳定）。200 items的stratified sampling提供更稳定估计，residual从0.176升至0.21反映了更大item\n    pool中的unmodeled item×condition microvariance。Gemma-2-9B-IT因其instruction-tuning风格对prompt\n    wording异常敏感（已知其system prompt格式要求严格），prompt×item interaction偏高，拉低了该模型的item_id相对份额。整体G=0.42仍然很低，验证了current\n    practice不可靠的核心论点。\n  tables:\n  - 'Table 1: Variance component estimates (% of total) by model — 4×12 matrix showing\n    each component per model plus pooled'\n  - 'Table 2: Accuracy means by precision level per model — confirms confound fix\n    (三者差异<1pp vs MVP的8.5pp)'\n  - 'Table 3: Model-level G coefficients under current practice conditions'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 1: Stacked bar chart of variance components, 4 models side-by-side + pooled,\n    showing item_id consistently largest but varying 36-48%'\n  - 'Fig 2: Heatmap of item×precision interaction — showing which item difficulty\n    bins still show precision sensitivity after fix'\n  analysis: 'Two-way ANOVA确认precision main effect在fix后从显著(p<0.001, η²=0.009)降为边际(p=0.03,\n    η²=0.008)。Bootstrap CI for item_id share: [0.38, 0.48]。Gemma异常通过leave-one-model-out\n    sensitivity analysis量化——移除Gemma后pooled item_id升至0.46。'\n- name: Multi-Benchmark Replication\n  plan_id: exp-002\n  description: 4 models × 2 precisions × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temps × 4 orderings\n    on GSM8K/ARC-C/HellaSwag (200 items each)\n  expected_results:\n    total_records_per_benchmark: 230400\n    gsm8k_item_id_share: 0.28\n    gsm8k_temperature_x_item: 0.12\n    gsm8k_seed_x_item: 0.08\n    gsm8k_residual: 0.27\n    gsm8k_prompt_main: 0.03\n    arc_challenge_item_id_share: 0.38\n    arc_challenge_residual: 0.22\n    arc_challenge_temperature_x_item: 0.07\n    hellaswag_item_id_share: 0.45\n    hellaswag_residual: 0.19\n    hellaswag_prompt_x_item: 0.05\n    cross_benchmark_item_dominance_as_largest: 3/4 benchmarks (GSM8K exception — residual+temp×item\n      jointly exceed item_id)\n    cross_benchmark_separability_holds: 3/4 benchmarks (direct infra×method < 0.02\n      everywhere)\n    g_gsm8k_current: 0.35\n    g_arc_current: 0.4\n    g_hellaswag_current: 0.48\n    replication_rate_item_as_single_largest: 0.625\n  result_rationale: GSM8K是reasoning task，CoT generation引入大量stochastic variance——temperature直接影响推理链的分支选择，且不同seed下同一难题可能走完全不同的推理路径，导致temperature×item和seed×item\n    interaction显著放大（合计0.20 vs MMLU的0.08）。residual也更高（0.27）因为generation过程本质上比MC selection更noisy。item_id仍有0.28但不再是单一最大源——residual(0.27)+temperature×item(0.12)合并后超过它。ARC-Challenge是science\n    MC，结构更接近MMLU但题目难度分布更极端（容易题ceiling effect），item_id=0.38。HellaSwag最接近MMLU pattern（都是MC、都是knowledge/commonsense），item_id=0.45。跨benchmark的核心发现：MC\n    benchmarks中item dominance稳健成立，但reasoning/generation benchmarks中variance structure根本不同——这本身成为novel\n    finding。Separability在所有benchmark都成立（direct interaction<0.02），因为hardware/precision\n    effects是low-level numerical的，与task type无关。\n  tables:\n  - 'Table 4: Cross-benchmark variance decomposition comparison — 4 benchmarks × top-8\n    components matrix'\n  - 'Table 5: Benchmark characteristics (task type, answer format, difficulty distribution)\n    vs variance structure mapping'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 3: Grouped stacked bars — 4 benchmarks side-by-side showing how variance\n    structure shifts from MC (item-dominated) to reasoning (residual/interaction-dominated)'\n  - 'Fig 4: Scatter plot of item difficulty vs item-level variance contribution across\n    benchmarks — showing ceiling/floor effects'\n  analysis: 'Kruskal-Wallis test on per-item variance contributions across benchmarks\n    confirms significant structural difference (H=47.3, p<0.001)。Permutation test\n    for ''item_id is single largest component'' yields replication probability 0.63\n    across random benchmark subsets。Key narrative shift: item dominance is benchmark-type-dependent,\n    strongest for knowledge MC tasks, weaker for reasoning generation tasks。'\n- name: Multi-Hardware G-Study\n  plan_id: exp-003\n  description: 4 models × 2 GPU types × 2 precisions × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps\n    × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items\n  expected_results:\n    hardware_status: second GPU arrived late — only 2 models × reduced seeds(3) completed\n      on GPU-2\n    hardware_main_effect: 0.012\n    hardware_x_precision: 0.006\n    hardware_x_prompt: 0.002\n    hardware_x_item: 0.018\n    hardware_x_temperature: 0.003\n    total_hardware_related_variance: 0.041\n    direct_hardware_x_methodology_interaction: 0.005\n    separability_conclusion: holds at aggregate level — direct hardware×method < 1%\n    item_id_with_hardware_facet: 0.41\n    g_with_hardware_generalization: 0.38\n    completeness: partial — 2/4 models fully crossed, 2/4 models only on primary GPU\n  result_rationale: 第二块GPU延迟到达，只能对Qwen3-8B和Llama-3.1-8B做完整crossing（reduced seeds=3以控制时间）。Hardware\n    main effect=0.012来自GPU间的kernel implementation差异（不同SM架构的floating-point rounding\n    path不同），但远小于item_id。hardware×item=0.018表明特定难题在不同GPU上表现不同——这是因为numerical edge cases（接近decision\n    boundary的logits）在不同GPU architecture上round differently。Direct hardware×methodology\n    interaction仅0.005，验证separability——但这个结论基于incomplete crossing需要谨慎表述。数据不完整意味着hardware\n    facet的估计CI较宽，论文中需作为limitation明确说明，但核心separability finding的方向性仍可支持。\n  tables:\n  - 'Table 6: Hardware facet variance components (with CI) — noting which estimates\n    are based on reduced crossing'\n  - 'Table 7: Separability test — direct interaction terms between hardware and each\n    methodology facet'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 5: Forest plot of hardware-related variance components with 95% bootstrap\n    CIs — showing most CIs include zero except hardware×item'\n  analysis: 'Mixed-effects model with GPU as random effect confirms hardware contributes\n    <2% unique variance。Acknowledge limitation: only 2 GPU types × partial model crossing\n    — separability conclusion is directional, not definitive。Frame as ''consistent\n    with separability'' rather than ''proves separability''。计划在camera-ready前补充完整数据。'\n- name: D-Study Projections\n  plan_id: exp-004\n  description: Compute optimal measurement allocation from combined exp-001/002/003\n    variance components\n  expected_results:\n    g_current_practice_mmlu: 0.42\n    g_current_practice_gsm8k: 0.35\n    g_current_practice_pooled: 0.39\n    g_triple_items_mmlu: 0.82\n    g_triple_prompts_mmlu: 0.51\n    g_triple_seeds_mmlu: 0.44\n    g_optimal_600items_mmlu: 0.87\n    g_optimal_600items_3prompts_mmlu: 0.91\n    items_needed_for_g90_mmlu: 520\n    items_needed_for_g90_gsm8k: 780\n    items_needed_for_g90_hellaswag: 380\n    cost_ratio_items_vs_prompts_for_g90: 3.8\n    cost_ratio_items_vs_seeds_for_g90: 7.2\n    budget_table_achievable_g90: 600 items × 3 prompts × 2 seeds — feasible but 3×\n      current practice\n  result_rationale: item_id占比从MVP的58%降至MMLU的43%、跨benchmark均值约35%，导致D-study中tripling\n    items的marginal gain缩小——从MVP预测的G提升0.35降至约0.25。具体来看：G(current)=0.42因为200 items在43%\n    item variance下仍然欠采样（需要~520 items才能让item sampling error降到可接受水平）。Triple items(600)→G=0.82而非MVP外推的0.90+，因为residual(0.21)设定了ceiling——即使无限items，residual\n    variance仍限制G上界约0.93。Triple prompts仅从0.42→0.51因为prompt-related variance(main+interactions)合计才~0.08，三倍prompt只压缩这小部分。Cost\n    ratio从MVP的'10×'降至3.8×：items仍是最cost-effective lever但优势缩小。GSM8K需要更多items(780)因为其residual更高且item\n    variance share更低——每增加一个item压缩的variance比例更小。这个'benchmark-dependent budget'本身成为实用贡献。\n  tables:\n  - 'Table 8: D-study projection matrix — rows=facet allocation scenarios, columns=benchmarks,\n    cells=projected G'\n  - 'Table 9: Practitioner budget table — ''to achieve G≥X on benchmark Y, sample\n    at least Z items with W prompts'''\n  - 'Table 10: Cost-effectiveness ratios — marginal G gain per additional level of\n    each facet'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 6: D-study curves — G vs number of items, with separate lines per benchmark,\n    horizontal reference at G=0.90'\n  - 'Fig 7: Allocation efficiency surface — 3D plot of items × prompts × projected\n    G, showing diminishing returns'\n  analysis: 'Sensitivity analysis: bootstrap resample variance components 1000×, compute\n    D-study projections for each → 95% CI on ''items needed for G≥0.90'' is [420,\n    680] for MMLU。Key message shift: ''tripling items is 3-5× more effective than\n    tripling prompts'' (down from ''10×'' in MVP)。仍然是strong practical recommendation但headline数字需要honest\n    reporting。'\n- name: 14B Model Extension\n  plan_id: exp-005\n  description: Qwen3-14B and DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B at BF16/FP16 on MMLU 200 items\n  expected_results:\n    qwen3_14b_item_id_share: 0.46\n    deepseek_r1_14b_item_id_share: 0.34\n    qwen3_14b_precision_main: 0.005\n    deepseek_r1_precision_main: 0.009\n    deepseek_r1_temperature_x_item: 0.11\n    scale_effect_on_variance_structure: mixed — dense 14B similar to 8B; reasoning-distilled\n      shows more temperature sensitivity\n    g_qwen3_14b_current: 0.47\n    g_deepseek_r1_14b_current: 0.38\n  result_rationale: Qwen3-14B作为dense model的scale-up版本，variance structure与8B系列相似但item_id略高(0.46)——更大模型对easy\n    items更consistently correct，使item difficulty gradient更极端，增加item方差贡献。DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B是reasoning-distilled模型，其CoT倾向使temperature\n    sensitivity大幅升高（temperature×item=0.11），类似GSM8K的pattern——即使在MC task(MMLU)上，该模型也倾向于'思考'，引入generation-like\n    variance。这导致其item_id share仅0.34。这个发现支持'variance structure depends on model architecture,\n    not just task type'的扩展论点。Precision main effect在两个14B模型上都很小（dense model更稳定），验证separability在larger\n    scale也成立。\n  tables:\n  - 'Table 11: 8B vs 14B variance component comparison — paired by architecture family'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 8: Paired bar chart — 8B vs 14B models showing variance structure shift with\n    scale'\n  analysis: 'Key finding: variance structure is jointly determined by task type AND\n    model architecture (specifically, reasoning-distilled models behave like ''reasoning\n    tasks'' even on MC benchmarks)。This adds nuance to the benchmark-dependent story。'\n- name: Fine-Tuning G-Study\n  plan_id: exp-006\n  description: 'RoBERTa-large on SST-2/MNLI/RTE/COPA: 6 seeds × 3 LR × 4 shuffles\n    × 3 GPUs × 2 precisions = 432 runs/task'\n  expected_results:\n    total_runs: 1728\n    sst2_seed_variance_share: 0.18\n    sst2_lr_variance_share: 0.31\n    sst2_item_id_variance_share: 0.22\n    sst2_shuffle_variance_share: 0.04\n    sst2_gpu_variance_share: 0.003\n    sst2_precision_variance_share: 0.006\n    sst2_residual: 0.15\n    sst2_seed_x_item: 0.05\n    rte_seed_variance_share: 0.28\n    rte_lr_variance_share: 0.22\n    rte_item_id_variance_share: 0.19\n    rte_seed_x_lr: 0.08\n    copa_instability: high residual (0.32) due to small dataset size\n    g_finetuning_current_practice: 0.52\n    g_finetuning_5seeds_3lr: 0.78\n    infra_method_separability_finetuning: holds — GPU×seed interaction < 0.5%\n  result_rationale: Fine-tuning的variance hierarchy与inference根本不同：learning rate成为dominant\n    factor(SST-2上0.31)因为它决定了optimization trajectory的convergence point——不同LR到达不同local\n    minima。Seed是第二大因素(0.18-0.28)因为weight initialization和data ordering jointly决定optimization\n    path。Item_id仍significant(0.19-0.22)但不再dominant——fine-tuning使模型适配了task distribution，减少了item\n    difficulty的极端效应。RTE上seed更重要(0.28)因为小数据集(2.5k training)使optimization对initialization更敏感。GPU\n    variance几乎为零(0.003)因为fine-tuning的随机性远大于hardware-level numerical差异。Data shuffle仅0.04——远低于预期，因为在足够epochs后shuffle的影响被averaged\n    out。核心对比：inference中item dominates(43%)，fine-tuning中LR+seed dominates(~50%)——practitioners需要不同的reproducibility\n    strategies for不同scenarios。\n  tables:\n  - 'Table 12: Fine-tuning variance decomposition — 4 tasks × top-8 components'\n  - 'Table 13: Inference vs fine-tuning variance hierarchy comparison'\n  - 'Table 14: Fine-tuning D-study — seeds and LR needed for G≥0.90'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 9: Side-by-side stacked bars — inference (MMLU) vs fine-tuning (SST-2) variance\n    decomposition showing inverted hierarchy'\n  - 'Fig 10: Fine-tuning D-study curves — G vs number of seeds, with LR as parameter'\n  analysis: The inverted hierarchy (item→LR+seed) between inference and fine-tuning\n    is a clean novel finding。It explains why the 'run 5 seeds and report mean±std'\n    convention exists for fine-tuning but not for inference evaluation。Separability\n    still holds in fine-tuning (GPU×methodology < 0.5%)，strengthening the cross-scenario\n    generalization of Claim 2。\n- name: LayerCast Precision Study\n  plan_id: exp-007\n  description: LayerCast (FP16 storage + FP32 compute) as 4th precision condition\n    on MMLU\n  expected_results:\n    layercast_accuracy: 0.68\n    layercast_vs_fp32_accuracy_diff: 0.006\n    layercast_vs_bf16_accuracy_diff: -0.001\n    layercast_item_level_agreement_with_bf16: 0.94\n    precision_variance_with_layercast: 0.005\n    precision_x_item_with_layercast: 0.022\n    variance_reduction_vs_mixed_precision: 15-20% reduction in precision-related variance\n      components\n  result_rationale: LayerCast在FP16存储但FP32计算，理论上获得FP32的numerical stability同时保持FP16的memory\n    efficiency。实测accuracy接近BF16/FP16（差异<0.1pp）而非接近pure FP32——这是因为在confound-fixed设置下FP32本身的accuracy已与BF16接近（差异<1pp），LayerCast的'storage\n    in FP16'引入的quantization noise在compute阶段被FP32 accumulation部分补偿。Precision×item interaction从0.032降至0.022——LayerCast减少了precision-sensitive\n    items上的variance但未完全消除（weight quantization仍在）。整体precision-related variance减少约18%，是有意义但非revolutionary的改进。作为mitigation\n    strategy，值得在discussion中推荐但不足以成为standalone contribution。\n  tables:\n  - 'Table 15: 4-level precision comparison (FP32/BF16/FP16/LayerCast) — accuracy\n    and variance metrics'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 11: Item-level accuracy correlation matrix across 4 precision conditions\n    — showing LayerCast clusters with BF16/FP16'\n  analysis: 'LayerCast provides modest variance reduction but does not fundamentally\n    change the story。Best framed as a practical recommendation in discussion: ''for\n    practitioners concerned about precision effects, LayerCast offers ~18% reduction\n    in precision-related variance at minimal memory cost''。'\n- name: MATH Benchmark Extension\n  plan_id: exp-008\n  description: MATH 200 items — reasoning-heavy with CoT, testing item dominance in\n    extended generation\n  expected_results:\n    math_item_id_share: 0.22\n    math_temperature_main: 0.04\n    math_temperature_x_item: 0.15\n    math_seed_x_item: 0.11\n    math_residual: 0.3\n    math_prompt_x_item: 0.06\n    math_precision_main: 0.005\n    math_g_current: 0.3\n    math_items_for_g90: 950\n    item_dominance_holds: false\n    separability_holds: true\n  result_rationale: MATH是最极端的reasoning benchmark——每题需要多步推导，CoT generation在每一步都受temperature和seed影响。Temperature×item=0.15因为难题（Level\n    4-5）的solution path高度branching——temperature=0.7时可能走对路径，temperature=0.3时可能卡在suboptimal\n    path。Seed×item=0.11同理——不同seed改变了sampling trajectory。Residual高达0.30反映了即使fixed所有facets，generation的intrinsic\n    stochasticity（vLLM default设置下的CUDA nondeterminism在long generation中累积）。Item_id仅0.22——仍然是single\n    largest individual component但margin很小（vs residual 0.30如果将residual视为'unexplained'则item不是最大）。这是median档下GSM8K\n    pattern的加强版，确认了'reasoning tasks have fundamentally different variance structure'。Separability仍成立（precision/hardware与methodology无direct\n    interaction>1%）——numerical precision不影响推理策略选择，只影响individual token probabilities。G=0.30极低，需要~950\n    items才能达到G≥0.90——对MATH这样仅500题的benchmark来说实质上不可达，这本身是对当前evaluation practice的strong\n    critique。\n  tables:\n  - 'Table 16: MATH vs GSM8K vs MMLU variance structure comparison — progression from\n    MC to light-reasoning to heavy-reasoning'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 12: Variance structure gradient plot — x-axis = ''reasoning intensity'' (MMLU→ARC→GSM8K→MATH),\n    y-axis = component shares, showing smooth transition from item-dominated to residual/interaction-dominated'\n  analysis: 'MATH completes the picture: variance structure is a continuous function\n    of task reasoning demands。For MC knowledge tasks, item selection is the key lever;\n    for reasoning tasks, temperature control and massive item sampling are both needed。The\n    ''one-size-fits-all'' reproducibility budget is insufficient — practitioners need\n    task-type-specific guidance。This benchmark-dependency finding becomes the paper''s\n    central novel contribution under the median tier narrative。'\n","numLines":311,"startLine":1,"totalLines":311}}}
