{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011bLQo6DMxXv34pSmeT8z56","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519/projects/nlp_variance_gtheory/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-20\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **bf16_eager_disentangle** (negative): The 8.5pp accuracy gap between FP32 and BF16 in MVP Phase A is primarily due to engine differences (V0 enforce_eager vs V1 CUDA graph), not numerical precision. Running BF16+enforce_eager should show similar degradation to FP32. ← 基于 mvp_phase_a\\\\n- **mvp_phase_a** (success): G-theory can successfully decompose infrastructure (precision) × methodology (prompt, seed, ordering, temperature) crossed variance components in LLM evaluation, with at least 2 components exceeding 5% of total variance and at least 1 significant precision×methodology interaction.\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 1 / 负向 1 / 失败 0 / 共 2\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestd-32570: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 800, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01K3nM3aGeK88QURntkQATCx","session_id":"73f25614-6311-4958-8c3c-0f90d7450270","uuid":"bd77d94d-70a7-4be6-9f40-71bc91c6bc3d","timestamp":"2026-05-20T19:39:06.942Z"}
